{
    "title": "Blessed - Daily Verse & Prayer",
    "description": "Are you on the hunt for a free Bible app to help you get closer to God? Look no further than Blessed, the ultimate app for daily Bible reading and spiritual growth. With Blessed, you can find solace in God's word, seek wisdom in times of confusion, and draw inspiration in moments of loneliness.\r\n\r\nBlessed now offers voice room service for all Christians! Join our Healing Chatrooms for calming and supportive conversations to help you heal and find answers to life's challenges. Open daily from 8 AM - 12 PM and 8 PM - 12 AM, with additional or reduced sessions at select times. \r\n\ufeff\r\nBlessed is free to download. Feel free to use the free version for as long as you'd like, or unlock all the content by upgrading to a premium membership! For the full Blessed experience, we offer 1-month and annual Premium auto-renewing subscriptions. \r\n \r\n\u3010Membership\u00a0exclusive\u00a0content\u3011\r\n- Audio Study Plans: Grow with Bespoke Bible Study. Customize your plans with lots of meditation audios, Remedy for life Bible Stories & facts. May you embrace a Blessed Life. Amen!\r\n \r\n\u3010Free\u00a0content\u3011\r\n- Daily Verse: In just 10 minutes a day, immerse yourself in God's words of wisdom and encouragement. The Daily Verse feature presents bite-sized pieces of scripture, accompanied by inspirational reflections and prayers. Engage with a global community of Christians through the comment feature and share your own insights and testimonies.\r\n\ufeff\r\n- Bible Reading: Take a deep dive into the teachings and promises of the Bible with the Blessed app. It enhances your Bible reading experience with powerful search capabilities, bookmarks, note-taking, and the ability to easily copy verses online. What's more, you can enjoy audio versions of multiple translations, including the NIV, ESV, and KJV, allowing you to listen to God's words in a soothing and relaxing manner.\r\n\ufeff\r\n- Pray: Overcome the challenges of praying with confidence and consistency. Blessed app provides a range of features including prayer guides, prompts, and a record of your prayers. Simply provide your prayer intentions and emotions to receive your personalized prayer. Engage effortlessly in daily prayers and foster a deeper conversation with God.\ufeff\r\n\ufeff\r\n- Bible Chat: Connect with your bible companion and seek answers to your questions about the Bible and related topics.Daily updated number of free conversations. \r\n\ufeff\r\n- Reminder and Calendar: Stay on track with your spiritual journey through reminders and a calendar feature. Set reminders to guide you in daily reflections and learning from God's word. The calendar helps you review what you have learned and celebrate your progress in building a closer relationship with God.\r\n\r\n- Subscription Information:\r\nBlessed offers 1-month and annual Premium auto-renewing subscriptions to provide you with unlimited access to VIP features and Unlock unlimited Bible chat conversations. Your payment will be charged to your iTunes Account as soon as you confirm your purchase. You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal from your Account Settings after the purchase. Your subscription will renew automatically unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. The cost of renewal will be charged to your account in 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. When canceling a subscription, your subscription will stay active until the end of the period. Auto-renewal will be disabled, but the current subscription will not be refunded. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when purchasing a subscription.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://blessed-h5.blessed-app.com/tos\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://blessed-h5.blessed-app.com/pp",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you on the hunt for a free Bible app to help you get closer to God? Look no further than Blessed, the ultimate app for daily Bible reading and spiritual growth. With Blessed, you can find solace in God&#39;s word, seek wisdom in times of confusion, and draw inspiration in moments of loneliness.<br><br>Blessed now offers voice room service for all Christians! Join our Healing Chatrooms for calming and supportive conversations to help you heal and find answers to life&#39;s challenges. Open daily from 8 AM - 12 PM and 8 PM - 12 AM, with additional or reduced sessions at select times. <br>\ufeff<br>Blessed is free to download. Feel free to use the free version for as long as you&#39;d like, or unlock all the content by upgrading to a premium membership! For the full Blessed experience, we offer 1-month and annual Premium auto-renewing subscriptions. <br> <br>\u3010Membership\u00a0exclusive\u00a0content\u3011<br>- Audio Study Plans: Grow with Bespoke Bible Study. Customize your plans with lots of meditation audios, Remedy for life Bible Stories &amp; facts. May you embrace a Blessed Life. Amen!<br> <br>\u3010Free\u00a0content\u3011<br>- Daily Verse: In just 10 minutes a day, immerse yourself in God&#39;s words of wisdom and encouragement. The Daily Verse feature presents bite-sized pieces of scripture, accompanied by inspirational reflections and prayers. Engage with a global community of Christians through the comment feature and share your own insights and testimonies.<br>\ufeff<br>- Bible Reading: Take a deep dive into the teachings and promises of the Bible with the Blessed app. It enhances your Bible reading experience with powerful search capabilities, bookmarks, note-taking, and the ability to easily copy verses online. What&#39;s more, you can enjoy audio versions of multiple translations, including the NIV, ESV, and KJV, allowing you to listen to God&#39;s words in a soothing and relaxing manner.<br>\ufeff<br>- Pray: Overcome the challenges of praying with confidence and consistency. Blessed app provides a range of features including prayer guides, prompts, and a record of your prayers. Simply provide your prayer intentions and emotions to receive your personalized prayer. Engage effortlessly in daily prayers and foster a deeper conversation with God.\ufeff<br>\ufeff<br>- Bible Chat: Connect with your bible companion and seek answers to your questions about the Bible and related topics.Daily updated number of free conversations. <br>\ufeff<br>- Reminder and Calendar: Stay on track with your spiritual journey through reminders and a calendar feature. Set reminders to guide you in daily reflections and learning from God&#39;s word. The calendar helps you review what you have learned and celebrate your progress in building a closer relationship with God.<br><br>- Subscription Information:<br>Blessed offers 1-month and annual Premium auto-renewing subscriptions to provide you with unlimited access to VIP features and Unlock unlimited Bible chat conversations. Your payment will be charged to your iTunes Account as soon as you confirm your purchase. You can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal from your Account Settings after the purchase. Your subscription will renew automatically unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. The cost of renewal will be charged to your account in 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. When canceling a subscription, your subscription will stay active until the end of the period. Auto-renewal will be disabled, but the current subscription will not be refunded. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when purchasing a subscription.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br><br>Terms of Use: https://blessed-h5.blessed-app.com/tos<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://blessed-h5.blessed-app.com/pp",
